WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.160 --> 00:00:04.960
Hi, Mystery Recapped here. Today, I’m&nbsp;
going to explain a science fiction action&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:04.960 --> 00:00:09.200
film called “District 9.” Spoilers&nbsp;
ahead! Watch out and take care!
&nbsp;

00:00:13.760 --> 00:00:18.640
The film opens with a documentary-style series&nbsp;
of interviews that introduce the story. Twenty&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:18.640 --> 00:00:24.640
years ago, in 1982, a giant extraterrestrial&nbsp;
spaceship had arrived above Johannesburg, South&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:24.640 --> 00:00:30.000
Africa. Humankind was shocked, because it was the&nbsp;
first instance of an alien species visiting them.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:30.560 --> 00:00:34.960
However, as the humans waited for aliens to&nbsp;
come out, the ship hovered over the city for&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:34.960 --> 00:00:39.840
three months with no sign of life. Eventually,&nbsp;
humans took the initiative and cut into the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:39.840 --> 00:00:44.480
ship to investigate what was inside. They were&nbsp;
surprised to have discovered a large group of&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:44.480 --> 00:00:49.360
aliens who were malnourished and sick. More than&nbsp;
a million aliens were given permission to leave&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:49.360 --> 00:00:54.480
their craft and live on Earth. The government of&nbsp;
South Africa relocated them to a terrestrial camp&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:54.480 --> 00:00:59.120
for their safety. They were housed in a squalid&nbsp;
government camp in Johannesburg, consisting&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:59.120 --> 00:01:04.400
mostly of rusty-looking one to two-room shacks.&nbsp;
However, over the years, the camp turned into a&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:04.400 --> 00:01:09.520
slum because of overcrowding and militarization.&nbsp;
Currently, the place is known as ‘district 9’.
&nbsp;

00:01:10.240 --> 00:01:15.440
It is now twenty years later since the ship&nbsp;
landed, and the aliens have repopulated into 1.8&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:15.440 --> 00:01:20.080
million of them. They cannot go back to their&nbsp;
planet, because during the landing, a command&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:20.080 --> 00:01:25.360
module had fallen into the earth’s surface and&nbsp;
was never found; hence, the giant extraterrestrial&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:25.360 --> 00:01:30.800
spaceship is still hovering above the city, but&nbsp;
is inoperable. Stuck in the slum for two decades,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:30.800 --> 00:01:35.520
the aliens have formulated their own lifestyle.&nbsp;
They started to ransack the nearest pile of&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:35.520 --> 00:01:40.720
garbage for food. The aliens had no sense of&nbsp;
ownership, so they burned and destroyed cars and&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:40.720 --> 00:01:46.560
other human properties. On top of that, the slum&nbsp;
was heavily armed, as a Nigerian black market sold&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:46.560 --> 00:01:52.000
human weapons to aliens at a high price. A massive&nbsp;
black market is set up between the aliens and a&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:52.000 --> 00:01:58.320
Nigerian gang of criminals led by a half-paralyzed&nbsp;
psychopathic man named Obesandjo. Obesandjo’s gang&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:58.320 --> 00:02:03.840
sold to them canned cat food, which happens to be&nbsp;
liked by the aliens. In addition, inter-species&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:03.840 --> 00:02:07.920
prostitution was also encouraged. 
The aliens have learned to speak and&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:07.920 --> 00:02:10.720
understand English, and are good&nbsp;
at communicating with humans.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:13.760 --> 00:02:18.880
However, they do not possess any leadership&nbsp;
qualities or functions. It is later assumed&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:18.880 --> 00:02:23.280
that a plague may have wiped out all of the&nbsp;
leadership-caste. Soon the Nigerians start to&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:23.280 --> 00:02:28.400
get fed up with the aliens. After twenty years,&nbsp;
they have put up signs in the park and shops,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:28.400 --> 00:02:33.040
banning them from entering. A derogatory term&nbsp;
“prawn” comes into fashion, referring to the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:33.040 --> 00:02:38.560
bottom-feeding sea creature they resemble. Humans&nbsp;
begin to riot and protest, to remove the Prawns&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:38.560 --> 00:02:43.280
from Johannesburg. The locals begin to complain&nbsp;
that the government is wasting too much money&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:43.280 --> 00:02:48.000
on this filthy creature. The aliens are being&nbsp;
called ignorant lawbreakers, who bleed resources&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:48.000 --> 00:02:53.440
from humans. Patience over the alien situation&nbsp;
among the people of Johannesburg has run out.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:53.440 --> 00:02:58.480
Following the dispute between the aliens and&nbsp;
locals, the government hires Multinational United&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:58.480 --> 00:03:04.160
(MNU), a private weapons manufacturer company,&nbsp;
that shows little regard for the aliens' welfare.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:04.160 --> 00:03:08.800
The aliens also have weaponry of their own,&nbsp;
which are engineered in a biological manner,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:08.800 --> 00:03:13.440
making them unusable for humans. The MNU&nbsp;
does research on such alien ammunition.
&nbsp;

00:03:14.160 --> 00:03:19.200
The MNU is tasked to relocate the aliens from&nbsp;
District 9 to a new camp outside the city.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:19.200 --> 00:03:24.000
An MNU field operative named Wikus van der&nbsp;
Merwe, is made the commander of the mission.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:24.000 --> 00:03:27.680
Wikus and a team of soldiers are sent&nbsp;
to district 9 to make the Prawns sign a&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:27.680 --> 00:03:33.440
contract of evacuation. With his assistant, and a&nbsp;
soldier, Wikus goes house to house in district 9.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:34.000 --> 00:03:38.400
They also shoot and kill some of the&nbsp;
uncooperative aliens. Then, they come across&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:38.400 --> 00:03:44.560
a house with alien eggs, and set it on fire. 
Meanwhile, three aliens, Christopher Johnson,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:44.560 --> 00:03:50.880
his young son CJ, and Christopher's friend, search&nbsp;
a garbage dump for alien fuel in Prawn technology.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:50.880 --> 00:03:55.040
Christopher has been working to synthesize a&nbsp;
liquid for the past twenty years and is finally&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:55.040 --> 00:04:00.720
successful. However, just then, Wikus and his team&nbsp;
arrive at his front door. Christopher’s friend&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:00.720 --> 00:04:05.280
goes to see Wikus, as Christopher hides the liquid&nbsp;
in the house and runs away through the back door.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:05.840 --> 00:04:10.240
Wikus and his team go inside the house to&nbsp;
search for weapons, where they find the liquid.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:10.240 --> 00:04:15.840
While inspecting it, Wikus accidentally sprays&nbsp;
it on his face. After composing himself, he puts&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:15.840 --> 00:04:20.960
the liquid in a bag to send it to the lab later.&nbsp;
Christopher’s friend starts to attack Wikus, so&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:20.960 --> 00:04:26.320
his team is shot dead by the soldiers. Wikus’s arm&nbsp;
is injured in the fight, so his assistant dresses&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:26.320 --> 00:04:31.760
it. Soon he starts feeling uncomfortable and sick.&nbsp;
He vomits while inspecting Christopher’s home.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:32.320 --> 00:04:36.400
His team takes him to a nearby restaurant&nbsp;
where his nose secretes a black fluid.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:36.400 --> 00:04:40.240
They start worrying for him, and take&nbsp;
him back to the MNU headquarters.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:40.240 --> 00:04:45.600
Wikus cannot stop coughing and feels dizzy; his&nbsp;
fingernails start to decay and fall off. Back at&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:45.600 --> 00:04:49.760
District 9, Christopher and his son desperately&nbsp;
search for the liquid they had hidden. 
&nbsp;

00:04:50.560 --> 00:04:55.920
That day, Wikus comes home to a surprise party.&nbsp;
As he is about to cut the cake, he vomits black&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:55.920 --> 00:05:01.840
substance all over it. The guests are disgusted.&nbsp;
His wife takes him to the doctor. He undoes the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:01.840 --> 00:05:06.160
dressing from his arms, and is horrified&nbsp;
to see it has changed into an alien claw.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:06.160 --> 00:05:11.280
Wikus panics and starts yelling, as the doctor&nbsp;
tries to calm him down. The doctor then calls&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:11.280 --> 00:05:16.720
the security and restrains Wiskus. They put&nbsp;
him in a body bag and take him to the MNU lab.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:16.720 --> 00:05:20.720
They find out that he is turning into an alien&nbsp;
because of the liquid that was splashed onto&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:20.720 --> 00:05:25.360
his face that day. They also find the liquid&nbsp;
in his pocket. The doctors perform several&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:25.360 --> 00:05:30.640
experiments on him. It turns out that Wiskus&nbsp;
can use the alien weapon that no humans can.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:30.640 --> 00:05:34.480
They even make him shoot an innocent&nbsp;
prawn, as he begs them to leave the guy.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:34.480 --> 00:05:38.880
The scientists discover that his DNA is&nbsp;
currently "in balance" with the alien DNA,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:38.880 --> 00:05:43.440
which is gradually transforming him completely&nbsp;
into a prawn. With the permission of Wikus'&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:43.440 --> 00:05:48.080
ruthless father-in-law, they decide to harvest&nbsp;
his body for biological material at this critical&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:48.080 --> 00:05:52.400
point, and sell them to the organizations and&nbsp;
governments who are keen on biotechnology. 
&nbsp;

00:05:53.200 --> 00:05:57.440
However, as they are about to perform the&nbsp;
procedures on him, he manages to break free&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:57.440 --> 00:06:02.160
and overpower his captors. He then flees from&nbsp;
the MNU headquarters and ends up in his home.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:02.720 --> 00:06:07.920
But the MNU agents are already there looking for&nbsp;
him. He goes to a nearby restaurant where he sees&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:07.920 --> 00:06:12.560
himself on the news. It is falsely reported that&nbsp;
he has had prolonged sexual intercourse with a&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:12.560 --> 00:06:18.000
prawn, making him turn into one of them. The news&nbsp;
also claims that his disease is contagious, and&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:18.000 --> 00:06:23.360
warns people to stay twenty feet away if they come&nbsp;
across him. With nowhere to go, he takes refuge in&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:23.360 --> 00:06:28.400
District 9. Wikus ends up in Christopher’s shed,&nbsp;
where he finds that Christopher has hidden the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:28.400 --> 00:06:33.440
spaceship’s command module that had disappeared&nbsp;
years ago. The liquid he prepared was the fuel to&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:33.440 --> 00:06:37.840
activate the ship again so they could go back&nbsp;
to their planet. The same fuel can help Wikus&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:37.840 --> 00:06:43.040
turn back to humans. So, the two prepare to go to&nbsp;
the MNU headquarters to bring back the liquid. 
&nbsp;

00:06:43.840 --> 00:06:47.840
Wikus goes to the gang leader, Obesandjo,&nbsp;
to buy some weapons for their quest.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:48.400 --> 00:06:53.680
However, Obesandjo wants to cut off Wikus’s&nbsp;
alien arm to eat it. The Nigeriens believe&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:53.680 --> 00:06:58.480
that eating alien body parts will get rid of&nbsp;
diseases according to a concept called Muti.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:58.480 --> 00:07:03.360
Before they can cut his arms, Wikus gets his&nbsp;
hands on an alien weapon and attacks the gang.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:03.360 --> 00:07:08.240
With the help of it, he collects all other weapons&nbsp;
and flees from there. Christopher and Wikus then&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:08.240 --> 00:07:12.880
attack the MNU headquarters. Because of the&nbsp;
weapons, they manage to wipe out most of the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:12.880 --> 00:07:17.920
lab within minutes. The Colonel who is in charge&nbsp;
of MNU’s security and has been tasked to capture&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:17.920 --> 00:07:23.760
Wikus, arrives with his squad. Wikus finally finds&nbsp;
the liquid; but just then, Christopher finds his&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:23.760 --> 00:07:29.680
fellow alien in the lab. He had been experimented&nbsp;
upon by humans. The soldiers get inside the lab&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:29.680 --> 00:07:35.360
and start firing at them. The two beak the walls&nbsp;
and manage to flee from there. However, the police&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:35.360 --> 00:07:40.320
chopper follows their car to district 9. 
Christopher and Wikus are now in his shed,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:40.320 --> 00:07:45.680
where Christopher reveals that he has to save his&nbsp;
people first, only then he will transform Wikus.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:45.680 --> 00:07:51.600
Agitated, Wikus hits him with a log and knocks&nbsp;
him out. He then powers up the ship himself. Wikus&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:51.600 --> 00:07:56.400
gets in it and flies the ship while the whole&nbsp;
world watches in awe. However, when the craft&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:56.400 --> 00:08:01.520
is midair, it is knocked out by an MNU missile.&nbsp;
The soldiers arrest Wikus from inside the ship,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:01.520 --> 00:08:07.520
while Christopher’s son, CJ hides. Just then, the&nbsp;
soldiers are attacked by Obesandjo and his men.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:08.160 --> 00:08:13.600
After an intense fight between them, Wikus is&nbsp;
captured by Obesandjo. Obesandjo is about to&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:13.600 --> 00:08:18.720
cut off Wikus’s arm to eat it, but is stopped when&nbsp;
little CJ activates an automated gun and fires at&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:18.720 --> 00:08:23.520
them. As Wikus escapes, the mother ship that had&nbsp;
been dormant for all these years starts moving.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:24.080 --> 00:08:28.080
Wikus then gets to the huge automated&nbsp;
battle suit and starts controlling it.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:28.080 --> 00:08:31.840
He initially plans to run away using it,&nbsp;
but then comes back to rescue Christopher.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:32.400 --> 00:08:36.960
The two start running towards the spacecraft, but&nbsp;
the battle suit is shot midway and stops working.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:37.520 --> 00:08:41.120
Wikus insists Christopher go save&nbsp;
his son and the other prawns.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:41.120 --> 00:08:45.520
Christopher promises him that he will be back in&nbsp;
three years, and turn Wikus back to normal. 
&nbsp;

00:08:46.240 --> 00:08:50.480
Wikus distracts the soldiers, as Christopher&nbsp;
takes his son and starts the mother ship.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:51.040 --> 00:08:53.840
It rises in the sky and finally&nbsp;
attaches to the spacecraft.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:54.480 --> 00:08:59.280
Below, an injured Wikus is arrested by the&nbsp;
Colonel who is about to kill him. However,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:59.280 --> 00:09:04.560
the other prawns stand up for Wikus. They circle&nbsp;
the colonel and rip his head off. The massive&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:04.560 --> 00:09:09.120
spaceship finally takes off with Christopher and&nbsp;
his son in it, as the whole world watches in awe.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:09.680 --> 00:09:13.840
People speculate that Christopher will come back&nbsp;
for the rescue mission to save all of his kinds.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:14.400 --> 00:09:18.960
Wikus has disappeared completely after the&nbsp;
incident, and no one knows his whereabouts.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:18.960 --> 00:09:23.680
The prawn relocating mission was successful.&nbsp;
Currently, they live in District 10,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:23.680 --> 00:09:29.440
which lies 200 kilometres outside of Johannesburg&nbsp;
and their population has increased to 2.5 million.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:30.080 --> 00:09:34.480
Then, we see footage of Wikus’s wife holding a&nbsp;
metal flower, which she claims she had found at&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:34.480 --> 00:09:40.000
her doorstep. She believes that Wikus put it there&nbsp;
and still has hopes of him being alive. The movie&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:40.000 --> 00:09:44.960
ends as we see a now fully transformed Wikus in a&nbsp;
junkyard, crafting a metal rose for his wife.
